Version: 1.0

RestoreWorkspace: Never
SaveWorkspace: Never
AlwaysSaveHistory: Default

EnableCodeIndexing: Yes
UseSpacesForTab: Yes
NumSpacesForTab: 2
Encoding: UTF-8

AutoAppendNewline: Yes
StripTrailingWhitespace: Yes
LineEndingConversion: Posix

MarkdownWrap: Column
MarkdownWrapAtColumn: 100

RnwWeave: knitr
LaTeX: pdfLaTeX
